   * **사용자 답**(AskUserQuestion header `[F1·#2] TS6`, 질문 `2026-10-02T08:44:44.040Z` tool_use `toolu_01HLTMDauSZH9jxzdknyfdds`, 답 `2026-10-02T08:48:18.666Z` tool_result uuid `e3ad3ff5-05d5-4aeb-8956-645e5e1e3d5d` -- jsonl 바이트 대조):
